 }</pre>

loadFromFile.docs:
Uses to get schematic from file.

 <pre>{@code
 function main(c)
 {
     var schematic = c.world.createSchematic();
     schematic.loadFromFile("mySchematic").place(0, 4, 4);
 }
 }</pre>
